{
  "schema": 1,
  "name": "Spectral Tiger reins select a riding-skill mount and allow normal dismount (#356)",
  "contract": [
    "Reins of the Swift Spectral Tiger 33225 and VanityCollection row 185 teach spell 42777, whose client",
    "description calls it an adaptive Spectral Tiger.",
    "The client provides Spectral Tiger 499910 with a 60% mounted-speed aura and creature 24003 (display 21973),",
    "and Swift Spectral Tiger 499909 with a 100% aura and creature 24004 (display 21974).",
    "Apprentice riding 75 must give 60% ground speed; Journeyman 150 and Artisan 300 must give 100%. A client",
    "dismount must clear the model and restore normal run speed.",
    "The test learns through the actual reins item and uses the reported Venomancer class and Orgrimmar position",
    "at supported level 80. It observes native mount state and speed, not rendered-client appearance."
  ],
  "timeout_ms": 60000,
  "location": {
